==English==

===Etymology===
First attested in 1615.    From {{L.}} '''[[somnolentus#Latin|somnolentus]]''' < '''[[somnus#Latin|somnus]]''' "sleep".  Replaced older form: [[sompnolente]].

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[drowsy]] or [[sleepy]]
# tending to cause sleepiness; [[soporific]]

